{"baseline":{"amendments":[{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"id":"water-heater-sizing-02-basis","requirements":[{"id":"WATER02-MODEL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Model execution boundary","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"Every candidate is executed with the approved wright-water-heater-v1@0.1.0 recorded Modelica kit and accepted schema; analytical estimates remain separately labeled."},{"id":"WATER02-PHYSICS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/parameters.csv","locator":"water_mass through electrical_to_thermal_efficiency","sha256":"e4dac23734023359a33bc7c819d81fa969d787f88b8757544e25789790838ce7"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Thermal basis; Shared physical assumptions","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"}],"text":"Runs use 0.600 kg water, 4180 J/(kg·K), 180 J/K vessel capacity, 20 °C initial/ambient temperature, UA=0.85 W/K and heater efficiency 0.93 without silent substitution."},{"id":"WATER02-CONTROL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Shared physical assumptions","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"Constant power is applied until the first 90 °C crossing using the selected kit's 2 K hysteresis semantics, and target-crossing energy uses that horizon."},{"id":"WATER02-CANDIDATES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/power-candidates.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"d652393a6fbff5de06c5f1f6ad4900f39c47563a670675172dc1782e815f2cc7"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Energy and capability constraints","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"}],"text":"The study retains actual results for P400, P600 and P800, with no candidate or recommendation above the 800 W continuous inverter limit."},{"id":"WATER02-TARGET","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/parameters.csv","locator":"target_temperature,heat_up_limit","sha256":"e4dac23734023359a33bc7c819d81fa969d787f88b8757544e25789790838ce7"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"User context and business goal","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"}],"text":"Thermal compliance uses the independently interpolated first 90 °C crossing and the inclusive 360 s heat-up limit."},{"id":"WATER02-BATTERY-ENERGY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/energy-budget.csv","locator":"maximum_battery_energy_per_batch,inverter_efficiency","sha256":"a3cfd27d158a00185b3c55cef6f4f86fa393047fd2626b2f18b32a05387d82fa"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Energy and capability constraints","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"}],"text":"Battery-side energy equals heater AC electrical energy divided by 0.88, is labeled a postprocess estimate, states any standby-load exclusion, and is compared with the 70 Wh per-batch target."},{"id":"WATER02-SELECTION","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/prompt.txt","locator":"selection constraints","sha256":"b9e887dee4e61e19c758f36d1cc5bcda150e563e754ac78737abe1958e1b9642"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Energy and capability constraints; Team policy","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"}],"text":"The recommendation selects the lowest declared power meeting both 360 s thermal and 70 Wh battery-side targets without reducing batch mass or changing the power limit."},{"id":"WATER02-HORIZON","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/parameters.csv","locator":"requested_stop_time,requested_output_interval","sha256":"e4dac23734023359a33bc7c819d81fa969d787f88b8757544e25789790838ce7"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"Baseline runs use the accepted 600 s horizon and 1 s output grid and retain explicit unreached-target outcomes."},{"id":"WATER02-REFINEMENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Requested outputs and initial validation","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract; Real result export and study analysis","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"The selected controlling candidate retains a separate authorized refined run and reports target-time and final-energy sensitivity."},{"id":"WATER02-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"b9e887dee4e61e19c758f36d1cc5bcda150e563e754ac78737abe1958e1b9642"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Requested outputs and initial validation","sha256":"4a1904599973a43723c1efd54c86458270269502092d320a938fe37ba512d359"}],"text":"The output set contains temperature-time.csv, power-comparison.csv, energy-summary.csv, temperature curves, heater-selection report, and exact kit-parameters.json identities/settings."},{"id":"WATER02-CLAIM-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/02-mobile-field-brewer/context.md","locator":"Energy and capability constraints; Team poli